msgid "2024-05-02"
msgstr "2 мая 2024 г."

#. type: TH
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#, no-wrap
msgid "Linux man-pages 6.9.1"
msgstr "Справочные страницы Linux 6.9.1"

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron
